        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "# Material Flow Investigation",
          "This optional notebook accompanies the HighTech workshop's production-quality graph lab. It teaches PGX algorithms using physical component movements between work centers. It is not the SQL/PGQ production-quality graph.",
          "Prerequisites: a PGQL property graph named MATERIAL_FLOW_GRAPH over WORK_CENTERS and MATERIAL_TRANSFERS, the TRANSFERS edge label, the CENTER_ID vertex property, and access to the in-memory PGX server. Before using this notebook, ask the workshop administrator to create the optional graph and enable PGX.",
          "Centers 534, 597, 934, 387, and 406 are sample dataset IDs. Outputs have been cleared. Run every paragraph in sequence to produce results; rankings, paths, and counts depend on the loaded graph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "Run the first `%python-pgx` paragraph. The built-in `session` reads the graph from the database into the in-memory server and creates a `PgXGraph` object for the algorithms."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%python-pgx",
          "",
          "GRAPH_NAME=\"MATERIAL_FLOW_GRAPH\"",
          "# try getting the graph from the in-memory graph server",
          "graph = session.get_graph(GRAPH_NAME)",
          "# if it does not exist read it into memory",
          "if (graph == None) :",
          "    session.read_graph_by_name(GRAPH_NAME, \"pg_pgql\")",
          "    print(\"Graph \"+ GRAPH_NAME + \" successfully loaded\")",
          "    graph = session.get_graph(GRAPH_NAME)",
          "else :",
          "    print(\"Graph '\"+ GRAPH_NAME + \"' already loaded\")"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "raw",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "Run the PGQL query to display 100 graph elements. In `MATCH (s)-[t]->(d)`, `s` is the source vertex, `t` the directed edge, and `d` the destination. `LIMIT` caps the returned elements.",
          "",
          "For more syntax examples, see the [PGQL specification](https://pgql-lang.org/) or the PGQL tutorial in the Getting Started notebook folder."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%pgql-pgx",
          "/* Query and visualize 100 elements (nodes and edges) of MATERIAL_FLOW_GRAPH */",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM MATCH (s)-[t]->(d) ON material_flow_graph",
          "LIMIT 100"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\": {\"vertexLabelProperty\": \"CENTER_ID\", \"layout\": \"concentric\", \"version\": 9}}]",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "Enter a center ID when you run the query. The query uses it as a bind parameter.",
          "",
          "Enter **534** as the center id, and then execute the paragraph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%pgql-pgx",
          "/* Check if there are any circular material-transfer chains of between 1 and 5 hops starting from the user-supplied center # */",
          "SELECT v,e,v2",
          "FROM MATCH ANY (a)-[:TRANSFERS]->{1,5}(b) ON material_flow_graph ONE ROW PER STEP (v,e,v2)",
          "WHERE a.center_id=${center_id} AND id(a) = id(b)"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\": {\"vertexLabelProperty\": \"CENTER_ID\", \"version\": 9}}]",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[{\"type\":\"TextBox\",\"name\":\"center_id\",\"displayName\":null,\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"argument\":null,\"isHidden\":false,\"isProgrammatic\":false}]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{\"center_id\":\"534\"}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "Find the 10 centers with the most transfers. `IN_DEGREE` and `OUT_DEGREE` count incoming and outgoing edges for each vertex.",
          "Choose **Table** after running the ranking query to read the numeric columns if Graph Studio opens a graph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%pgql-pgx",
          "/* List 10 centers with the most number of material transfers (that is, incoming + outgoing edges) */",
          "SELECT a.center_id, (in_degree(a) + out_degree(a)) AS num_transfers",
          "FROM MATCH (a) ON material_flow_graph",
          "ORDER BY num_transfers DESC",
          "LIMIT 10"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\": {\"version\": 9}}]",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "Review the centers with the highest degree. The sample data includes center 934 as a starting point for a circular material-transfer investigation. A high degree means many connected transfers; inspect those transfers before drawing conclusions about quality. The next query checks four-hop cycles with ONE ROW PER STEP so you can see each vertex and edge."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "result": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%pgql-pgx",
          "/* Check if there are any circular material-transfer chains of length 4 from center 934 */",
          "SELECT v,e,v2",
          "FROM MATCH ALL (a)-[:TRANSFERS]->{4}(b) ON material_flow_graph ONE ROW PER STEP (v,e,v2)",
          "WHERE a.center_id=934 AND id(a) = id(b)",
          "LIMIT 100"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\": {\"filters\": [{\"_id\": 1661441592752, \"component\": \"vertex\", \"type\": \"styling\", \"target\": \"vertex\", \"enabled\": true, \"conditions\": {\"operator\": \"and\", \"conditions\": [{\"property\": \"CENTER_ID\", \"operator\": \"=\", \"value\": \"934\"}]}, \"properties\": {\"colors\": [\"red\"], \"sizes\": [17]}, \"aggregation\": []}], \"vertexLabelProperty\": \"CENTER_ID\", \"version\": 9}}]",
